# ☁️ Azure Storage Account & Blob Storage

## 📌 Project

This project demonstrates creating an Azure Storage Account, creating a Blob Container, uploading files, understanding Blob URLs, and securely accessing blobs using a Shared Access Signature (SAS).

---

## 🎯 Objective

- Create an Azure Storage Account
- Create a Blob Container
- Upload files to Azure Blob Storage
- Understand Blob URL access
- Generate Shared Access Signature (SAS)
- Access private blobs securely

---

## ☁️ Azure Services Used

- Azure Storage Account
- Azure Blob Storage
- Blob Container
- Shared Access Signature (SAS)
- Azure Portal

