# 🛠 Troubleshooting

## Issue

Unable to access the uploaded blob using the Blob URL.

### Error

```
PublicAccessNotPermitted

Public access is not permitted on this storage account.
```

### Root Cause

The Storage Account was configured to block anonymous public access.

### Resolution

Generated a Shared Access Signature (SAS) with the required permissions and accessed the blob using the generated SAS URL.

